  "content": "<center>\n\n![加勒比海盗混搭包标题](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/bkDlbAtL/images/3c06aef2869eb18aa61173a22e6a3afa3f041b49.png)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">加勒比海盗混搭包</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"\">\n  <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub赞助\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\n能拿多少拿多少，什么都不用还！加入杰克和他的船员们，体验《加勒比海盗》混搭包，其中包含你最喜欢的各路流氓和捣蛋鬼。规划航线，从托尔图加岛出发，途经沉船湾，一路直达戴维·琼斯的魔柜。这一天，你将永远铭记为与杰克·斯派洛船长一同航行的日子。\n\n本包特色：专属纹理套装、主题菜单和原创原声音乐。\n<p></p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n![世界预览](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/bkDlbAtL/images/95223a31c77eff8522580e13deab0241f81ad9c2.jpeg)\n\n<details>\n<summary>更多资源包</summary>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th align=\"center\">图标</th>\n      <th>名称</th>\n      <th>下载量</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/770e36a855375d291ea82a6cb093a9340b5e38cc.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"塑料纹理包图标\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/plastic-texture-pack\">塑料纹理包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/plastic-texture-pack?logo=Modrinth&label=下载量\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/77241b565d355ba5369dbb1bee133a266